  "content": "# 蒸汽船威利\n你没看错——这就是华特·迪士尼的原版《蒸汽船威利》动画，现在直接呈现在Minecraft的绘画中。\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7TywWpAyBUw\" title=\"YouTube视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n我热爱公有领域\n\n## 🏳️‍🌈-骄傲工艺\n你是否曾觉得你的游戏太无聊、太单调了？那已经成为过去！今天就获取[骄傲包](https://pridecraft.gay/pridepack) *(或[它的变体](https://git.pridecraft.gay))*吧！\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPbBrzEX/images/f74e7f243502e23ec6f8805d38a4c6a5a06df292.png\" alt=\"比伊斯\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\">",
